  "aadt_note": "hourly volume = AADT / 24 (flat profile); 75 % of in-box local segments carry the 1,000 vpd default of graph_segments.json",
  "method": "closed stretch (touching closed segments): its largest AADT detours from the busiest open entry to the busiest open exit at another junction, extra = wet - dry shortest time (whole MA graph); no detour within 30 min -> 30 min and the trips counted unserved; shared over the stretch by AADT x length; slowed: t_dry (1/f - 1); no traffic assignment (lower bound)"
 },
 "definitions": {
  "Q_eff": "E(t) / E_dry x 100, E = global efficiency (Latora & Marchiori 2001) of the in-box segment graph, travel-time weighted; N fixed at the dry count",
  "Q_access": "mean over hospital (30 min), fire station (8 min), police (10 min) of in-box residents (2020 Census blocks) within the standard of an open facility, now / dry x 100",
  "Q_access_km": "mean over hospital (30 min), fire station (8 min), police (10 min) of in-box road-km within the standard of an open facility, now / dry x 100",
  "Q_traffic": "sum AADT L f(t) / sum AADT L x 100, f = Pregnolato speed ratio, 0 when closed",
  "resilience_loss_pct_h": "integral (100 - Q) dt over the window (Bruneau et al. 2003)",
  "resilience_index": "integral Q dt / (100 T) (Cimellaro et al. 2010; Ouyang et al. 2012)",
  "robustness_pct": "min Q",
  "recovery_to_90_h": "hours from the minimum until Q >= 90 % (null: not inside the window)",
  "closure": "segment depth >= 30 cm closed; 5-30 cm slowed by Pregnolato et al. 2017"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "The modelled window ends 48 h after t0; water ponded in closed depressions of the lidar DEM (no storm drains beyond 2 mm/h) keeps about 115 segments closed at the end, so recovery times are lower bounds / null and RL depends on the window length.",
  "Population: 2020 Census block counts at block internal points, each block on its nearest road segment; residents of a closed segment count as without coverage and isolated (stay-at-home is not modelled); night-time (residential) population, not daytime.",
  "AADT of local roads is mostly a 1,000 vpd default.",
  "Delay has no traffic assignment (no congestion on detours) and a flat daily volume profile."
 ],
